, throughput, and operability constraints?\nDatasets: platform_requirements (adr-input-v2)\nEntities: Kafka [technology; role=candidate]\nSummary: Select the event bus for the microservices platform","tags":["task:id:019d12a6_4b49_7751_8a6c_bef7044382b0","task:artifact:019d12a6_4b49_7751_8a6c_bf06b1da75c1","task:kind:task_start","task:status:in_progress","task:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","task:entity:kafka::technology","task:projection:task_goal"],"hash":"d064bba2e10ad78c64f40f904c2ac8e04a7536d61ee7da96a2ba7f354b344082"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a6-4b49-7751-8a6c-bf43abc56cc9","tenant_id":"phase5_task_memory","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134381385,"chunk_type":"plan","status":"final","source":{"tool_name":"task.start"},"text":"Goal: Select the event bus for the microservices platform\nMotivation: The platform needed durable event replay and throughput guarantees while preserving an auditable decision trail\nHypothesis: Kafka would satisfy replay and throughput requirements better than RabbitMQ\nExpected outputs: decision summary, trade-off list, follow-up migration plan","tags":["task:id:019d12a6_4b49_7751_8a6c_bef7044382b0","task:artifact:019d12a6_4b49_7751_8a6c_bf06b1da75c1","task:kind:task_start","task:status:in_progress","task:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","task:entity:kafka::technology","task:projection:task_goal"],"hash":"9c17d4d5fce97c1687e38655f425d56f25273f09c4d5db8d934a6b841a605a10"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a6-52f9-7902-8d3a-df83624078b2","tenant_id":"phase5_task_memory","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134383353,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{"tool_name":"task.progress"},"text":"Task task_progress status in_progress for task 019d12a6-4b49-7751-8a6c-bef7044382b0.\nDatasets: platform_requirements (adr-input-v2)\nEntities: Kafka [technology; role=candidate]\nSummary: Narrowed the evaluation to Kafka versus RabbitMQ","tags":["task:id:019d12a6_4b49_7751_